# Shared by EVERY Vercel project built from this repo — the whitelist must
# cover each project's tree, not just Bridge. Builds clone from git, so a
# whitelisted directory only adds TRACKED files (no node_modules weight).
/*
!Applications
Applications/*
!Applications/BridgePlatform
!Components
Components/*
!Components/laic-learner-contracts
!Components/laic-learning-platform
# TheNexusPlatform: app_shell (App Studio), platform_logic (console), backend-ts (API)
!TheNexusPlatform
Applications/BridgePlatform/apps/bridge-web/.data
Applications/BridgePlatform/apps/bridge-web/e2e
Applications/BridgePlatform/apps/bridge-web/test-results
# The e2e dev server's build dir — its turbopack cache grows past Vercel's
# 100 MB per-file upload limit and hangs/fails the deploy.
Applications/BridgePlatform/apps/bridge-web/.next-e2e
Applications/BridgePlatform/apps/bridge-web/playwright-report
